@startuml
[*] --> Start
Start --> Login : User attempts to login
Login --> Home : Login successful
Login --> Login : Login failed
Home --> AddContact : User selects to add new contact
Home --> ViewContacts : User selects to view contacts
Home --> FilterContacts : User selects to filter contacts
Home --> ShareContacts : User selects to share contacts
Home --> ExportContacts : User selects to export contacts
Home --> SetReminder : User selects to set reminder
Home --> Logout : User selects to logout
AddContact --> Home : Contact added successfully
AddContact --> AddContact : Error adding contact
ViewContacts --> Home : View contacts completed
FilterContacts --> Home : Filter applied
ShareContacts --> Home : Contacts shared
ExportContacts --> Home : Export completed
SetReminder --> Home : Reminder set
Logout --> [*] : Logout successful
@enduml
